OL,3,AOpenAI boss says world 'right to be
OL,4,Aafraid' but should trust AI firms
OL,5,
OL,6,FBut critics say firms cannot be trusted
OL,7,Fto self-regulate, with left-wing
OL,8,FSenator Bernie Sanders and Steve
OL,9,FBannon, a former adviser of US
OL,10,FPresident Donald Trump, among those
OL,11,Fcalling for greater governance of AI.
OL,23,APub: 15-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG4/20
