OL,3,AAuthor and critic Bonnie Greer dies
OL,4,Aaged 77
OL,5,
OL,6,FBritish-American author and cultural
OL,7,Fcommentator Bonnie Greer has died at
OL,8,Fthe age of 77 after a brief illness,
OL,9,Fher husband has said.
OL,11,FIn a statement delivered with "profound
OL,12,Fsadness", Greer's widower David
OL,13,FHutchins described her as "an acclaimed
OL,14,Fplaywright, author, critic, cultural
OL,15,Fand political commentator whose
OL,16,Fintelligence, courage and distinctive
OL,17,Fvoice made an enduring contribution to
OL,18,FBritish cultural and public life".
OL,23,APub: 16-SepQpppppppppppppppppppppG15/20
OL,24,ANext PageBCultureC Nat RadioFTechnology
FL,164,160,200,105,0,100
PN,11916
SC,0016
CT,25,T
PS,c000
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F119A1789568312
OL,1,W5j 5Q7+j 55"k#j 5w;js1
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-.*,%-,* *,%%**,$ ,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,AAuthor and critic Bonnie Greer dies
OL,4,Aaged 77
OL,5,
OL,6,FHe added: "To me, she was my partner,
OL,7,Fconfidante and inspiration, and I feel
OL,8,Fprofoundly privileged to have shared my
OL,9,Flife with her."
OL,11,FHutchins continued: "Those closest to
OL,12,FBonnie will remember her warmth,
OL,13,Fhumour, generosity and extraordinary
OL,14,Fability to bring people together."
OL,23,APub: 16-SepQpppppppppppppppppppppG16/20
